Description:
 linuxmuster-api7 - Api for the linuxmuster.net 7 server.
Changes:
 linuxmuster-api7 (7.4.14) lmn74; urgency=medium
 .
   * [security] Basic auth accepts non-ASCII credentials, decoded as UTF-8
     with a Latin-1 fallback. FastAPI only decoded ASCII, so a password
     accepted by set-current-password, like one with umlauts, ß or €,
     could never be used to log in. Fix #47, reported by @TomlDev.
   * [groups] PATCH /groups/{group} only writes the flags it is sent. The
     schema defaulted join to True and hide, mailalias and maillist to
     False, so a patch only renaming a group also unhid it and made it
     joinable. Fix #49, reported by @Maddi02, whose tests were taken
     over.
   * [devices] PATCH /devices/{device} passes the school when writing the
     credentials of a device, which were looked for in default-school
     only. Thanks to @amolani (#42).
   * [linbo] New POST /linbo/restart-services, restarting linbo-multicast
     and linbo-torrent after a change on an image. The services are
     global: a school-administrator restarts them for every school.
     Fix #43, reported by @TomlDev.
   * [linbo] New GET /linbo/sync/onboot, GET and DELETE
     /linbo/sync/onboot/{hostname}, to list, read and withdraw the
     commands waiting for a host's next boot. A school-administrator
     only sees the hosts of their school. Fix #44, reported by @TomlDev.
   * [linbo] POST /linbo/hosts/query, GET /linbo/configs and POST
     /linbo/hosts/scan return an empty list instead of a 404 when
     nothing matches. Fix #45, reported by @TomlDev.
   * [linbo] GET /linbo/changes no longer misses a change made in the
     same second as the cursor. The deletedHosts and deletedStartConfs
     fields, always empty, are removed. See linuxmuster-tools#38.
   * [sessions] Session members are sorted in natural order.
   * [devices] GET /devices/roles reads the computer roles from the new
     SophomorixIni.computer_roles.
   * [packaging] Depends on linuxmuster-tools7 (>= 7.4.19).
